...are living happily, even to this day.

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:37.320
It's a dream that I've had ever since I was little...

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:42.820
That someday, I'd get to ride
that trolley with the one I love.

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:48.420
And I... hope that you are that person, Madoka.

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:51.750
Sumire!

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:54.670
I knew it had to be something like that!

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:57.810
Yesterday was so shocking
because it happened so suddenly...

00:15:57.810 --> 00:15:59.710
Still, I knew it sounded strange!

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:04.730
After all, Darling, only I
can steal your heart away!

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:10.730
At any rate, we've got to get
that tramp off Madoka's back!

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:14.030
Thank you, Hikaru...
But, how do we do that?

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:15.660
It's all because Madoka doesn't have...

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.890
...a boyfriend that everyone knows about!

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:20.430
No wonder that tramp follows her around!

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:21.730
A boyfriend that everyone knows about?!

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:23.270
Oh, I know!

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:28.290
That's it! I'll crush the dream of that Endangered-Species-Wacko-Babe!

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:32.840
Okay, that's it for today.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:35.710
Oh, Kasuga. Come to the
Student Disciplinary Office for a minute.

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.550
Huh...?! Yes, sir.

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:40.940
Hee Hee! That Kasuga!
What's he done this time?!

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.350
You guys!

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:47.060
Don't hold it against me, Kasuga. It's all your own fault anyway!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:49.080
How sad!

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:54.390
"Hoshi"

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:54.500
Oh...?
"Hoshi"

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:55.090
"To Hoshi Sumire"
Oh...?

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:55.350
Oh...?

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:59.100
"I've finally made up my mind."

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:02.940
"Meet me at the old factory site's materials lot." -- Madoka.

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:04.580
Oneesama!

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.440
Kasuga, explain yourself.

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:09.130
Oh! Oh! It's not what you think, sir.
Kasuga, explain yourself.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:09.210
Kasuga, explain yourself.

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:13.290
It's not, eh? This is nothing less than
illicit sexual misconduct!

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:15.480
But... like I said...

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:18.910
I hear that you've been pestering
that freshman, Hiyama Hikaru, huh?

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:21.290
What?! That's ridiculous!

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:22.420
"Sempai..."

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:26.360
"Please come to the old factory site's materials lot after school today!"

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:30.730
"If you don't, somebody's gonna
steal Madoka away! You've got to come!"

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:33.000
Hey, Kasuga! Kasuga!

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:34.200
Ayukawa!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:36.570
What?! You're up to something with Ayukawa too?!

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:37.770
I've gotta go!

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:40.730
Hold it, you! We're not done yet!
I've gotta go!

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:42.770
I'm sorry!
Hold it, you! We're not done yet!

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:46.000
Wait, you! Kasuga!

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:49.520
What?! Sumire is eloping with Ayukawa?!

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:50.820
That's right, hon!

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:53.720
I heard that they looked really happy, and were headed to a factory site!

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:54.850
Girl, I'll be damned!

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:57.410
Anyway, we've got to hurry!
Girl, I'll be damned!

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:01.470
Hey! Have you heard?!
Ayukawa's gonna hand Kasuga an ultimatum!

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.530
What?! At the former factory site, right?

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:05.660
Maybe he's gonna fight Mr. Matsuoka!

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:06.900
Hey! Let's go check it out!

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:07.690
Y...Yeah!
Hey! Let's go check it out!

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:07.770
Hey! Let's go check it out!

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:09.900
Everyone! This is an emergency!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:12.740
Believe it or not,
Mr. Matsuoka is eloping with Kasuga!

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:14.350
WHAT?!

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:18.650
"Is that clear, Sempai?
You have to act like lovers in front of her!"

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:20.450
"Lovers bound by a bond of love so tight...

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:23.320
"...that not even that tramp can break it!
That's our act!"

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:27.340
"Can you do it? Can you pretend that you're lovers... you and Madoka?"

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:35.530
What's taking him so long? What's Sempai up to?

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:37.530
Oh!

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:46.260
Ayukawa!

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:52.920
Hikaru told me what she had to say, but...

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:55.550
...just to let you know,
I don't believe everything she said.

00:18:55.550 --> 00:18:58.700
Madoka! This isn't the time for
that kind of thing!

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:02.820
H...Hikaru!

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:04.660
Okay, we'll begin, then!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:07.120
I'll feed you your lines, okay?

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:11.460
Why... is that wolf here?!

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:12.390
Sempai:
Why... is that wolf here?!

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:12.470
Why... is that wolf here?!

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:15.770
"Ayukawa, I've always had feelings for you..."

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:16.530
What?!

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.730
Sempai! Don't look at me!
What?!

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:22.050
Come on! Please say the line!

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:23.380
Ayukawa...

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:26.410
...I've always had feelings for you...

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:32.890
Madoka, you should be
looking into Sempai's eyes!

00:19:32.890 --> 00:19:34.190
Come on...

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:38.230
"Likewise... After all, you're my type, Kasuga."

00:19:38.230 --> 00:19:40.260
Madoka!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:45.530
Likewise...

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:47.890
Likewise... Kasuga,
I too have feelings for you...

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:52.600
This can't be!

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:54.710
Yes! You're doing very well!

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:57.310
"Sempai: Grabs Madoka's hand."

00:19:57.310 --> 00:20:01.910
"Sempai: In our future, we will ring the wedding bell together for sure."

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:05.250
In our future, we two will ring the wedding bell together.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:06.120
Yes.

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:08.710
"Madoka: Yes." Huh? Oh?!
Yes.

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:08.790
Yes.

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:11.980
"Then the two kiss passionately..."

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:15.130
Ayukawa...

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:17.190
Kasuga...

00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:22.530
No way! I don't believe it!

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:25.490
Wait... Wait a second!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:30.440
Th... This can't be...

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:32.840
No! NO...!

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:35.880
Hikaru!

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:36.400
Hikaru!           Hikaru!

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:39.420
You still don't get it, do you?!

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:43.690
These two are really... really in love!

00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:45.890
Anybody who dares to interfere with two people in love...

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:47.830
...ought to be savaged to death by dogs!

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:50.590
I get it! This was all a skit.

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:54.870
You planned it together, hoping that I'd give up.

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:57.410
That's not it, Sumire...

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:59.370
My...

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:02.560
My true feelings... for Ayukawa are...

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:10.780
Kasuga...

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:13.950
Hey! Kasuga!

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:14.210
Kasuga!
Hey! Kasuga!

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:14.780
It's a duel!
Kasuga!

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:14.920
It's a duel!

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.250
This means war!
It's a duel!

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:17.680
They're eloping!
This means war!

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:17.760
They're eloping!

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:21.810
Oh, shoot! Lemme see here...

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:24.880
I won't let you get away, Kasuga!

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.360
Oneesama! This way!

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:29.350
They're getting away!
Oneesama! This way!

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:31.830
Kasuga!

00:21:40.180 --> 00:21:42.140
C'mon! This way!

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:46.340
Oneesama! C'mon, hop on! Let's make a run for it!

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:48.820
Oneesama! Hurry!

00:21:50.650 --> 00:21:52.390
Oneesama!

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:55.360
Darling! Hurry up!
Oneesama!

00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:58.660
Wait!

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:04.710
Oneesama, please don't go!

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:08.640
Where would I be without you, Onee-sama?! What shall I do?!

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:10.670
Oneesama!

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:15.800
The trolley... is leaving me...

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:19.950
My trolley...

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:31.020
Kasuga... What were you trying to say before?

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:36.130
"My true feelings... for Ayukawa are..."

00:22:47.940 --> 00:22:51.790
Umm... I wonder, though...
where are we going to end up?

00:22:51.790 --> 00:22:54.890
It looks like it's a loop around the factory.

00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:56.280
What?!

00:22:58.090 --> 00:23:00.050
Where did they go?!

00:23:08.630 --> 00:23:12.260
All the misunderstandings about me have apparently been cleared up...

00:23:12.930 --> 00:23:15.040
Hikaru-oneesama!

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:16.810
Please, wait for me!

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:20.280
I already have my Darling, thank you!

00:23:20.280 --> 00:23:21.640
Wait for me!

00:23:21.640 --> 00:23:23.440
Darling, help!
Wait for me!

00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:23.520
Wait for me!

00:23:23.520 --> 00:23:26.390
The gorgeous Madoka-oneesama is certainly wonderful, but...

00:23:26.390 --> 00:23:29.050
...I love the cutesy Hikaru-oneesama too!

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:30.390
Oh!

00:23:30.390 --> 00:23:34.400
Indeed... I understand just how Sumire feels.

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:35.460
Gotcha!

00:23:35.460 --> 00:23:37.430
Gimme a break!
Gotcha!

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:58.590
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:23:58.590 --> 00:24:02.460
At a train station on a faraway day...

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:14.170
...snowflakes dance on the platform,
and you came running, out of breath.

00:24:14.170 --> 00:24:19.940
The days we had to be apart made the memory of you...

00:24:19.940 --> 00:24:28.280
...a happy one, like seeing your photograph.

00:24:28.280 --> 00:24:35.820
"I just dance in the sweet memories" Each time we're hurt we learn...

00:24:35.820 --> 00:24:43.470
"I just dance in the sweet memories" ...what it takes to love someone.

00:24:43.470 --> 00:24:51.110
"I just dance in the sweet memories"
(He's my one and only; you never can tell)

00:24:51.110 --> 00:24:58.650
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:24:58.650 --> 00:25:04.670
"I just dance in the sweet memories"

00:25:12.650 --> 00:25:16.500
I... spent the night with Yukari after she invited me over.

00:25:16.500 --> 00:25:19.230
It... It's not like we did
something we shouldn't have!

00:25:19.230 --> 00:25:23.470
Alas, Hikaru totally misunderstood me,
and said, "I'll kill myself!"

00:25:23.470 --> 00:25:26.010
So she takes the midnight train and leaves!

00:25:26.010 --> 00:25:29.760
Next time: "Heartbroken Hikaru! Follow Her to the Winter Beach."
